{"sections":[{"slug":"ddc引理","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"ddc引理"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“ddc <span lang=\"zh\">引理</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“ddc 引理”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>$dd^c$-<span lang=\"zh\">引理是指如下的命题</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">考虑复流形上微分形式的微分算子</span> $d= \\partial + \\bar\\partial$, $d^c = i (\\bar\\partial - \\partial)$, <span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $d$, $d^c$-<span lang=\"zh\">闭形式</span> $\\alpha$, <span lang=\"zh\">如下三个条件等价</span>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\alpha$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $d$-<span lang=\"zh\">恰当形式</span>;</li>\n<li>$\\alpha$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $d^c$-<span lang=\"zh\">恰当形式</span>;</li>\n<li>$\\alpha$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $dd^c$-<span lang=\"zh\">恰当形式</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Kähler流形","text":"Kähler <span lang=\"zh\">流形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">满足</span> $dd^c$-<span lang=\"zh\">引理</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}